:: Kitchen [location] {"position":"150,1550","size":"100,100"}
<<CheckLocation>>
<<silently>>
<<set _meal = "a weird hour">>
<<switch $time.current.value>>
	<<case 0>><<set _meal = "breakfast">>
	<<case 2>><<set _meal = "lunch">>
	<<case 4>><<set _meal = "dinner">>
<</switch>>
<</silently>>

The kitchen is bright and orderly: white shaker cabinets, glossy subway tile, and dark counters that wrap into a tidy U. The stainless hood hums quietly above the stove; glass-front uppers show off neatly stacked dishes, and the big spring faucet over the sink looks like it means business. A bowl of fruit and a couple of potted herbs sit where the light hits best. It smells like lemon cleaner and coffee that was made not too long ago.

If I'm hungry, I can [[raid the fridge|Activity Fridge]].<<if _meal != "a weird hour" && !$microEventActive>> It's about time for _meal, too, so I could [[throw something together|Activity Cook]].<</if>>

/* breakfast, lunch and dinner (micro events 0-2) show who is at the table themselves */
<<if !($microEventActive && [0, 1, 2].includes($currentMicroEvent))>>
	<<CheckNPCLocation>>
<</if>>
<<CameraSpot>>

<<nobr>>
<div class="navigation-link">
	[[Hallway]]
</div>
<</nobr>>


